       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Items A3 paper and printer paper are not present in the inventory catalog.\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Attempted restock order for 10,000 sheets of A4 paper failed due to zero available funds; $500 funding is </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">needed.\\n\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Required Actions:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"1. Secure additional funding of $500 to restock A4 paper.\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"2. Update the inventory catalog to include A3 paper and printer paper.\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"3. Once funding and catalog updates are completed, restock and reorder paper supplies promptly to meet the </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">April 15, 2025 conference deadline.\\n\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please escalate this report to the finance and inventory management teams immediately to avoid any supply </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">disruption.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_answer(report)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
