       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">of stock and need restocking. There are no available products or SKUs in inventory to fulfill the order </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">immediately. The next step is to place restock orders for these items to ensure availability for future orders.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">I will initiate restock orders with the inventory_agent specifying the quantities requested in the original order </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">(500 sheets cardstock, 250 sheets A4 printer paper) to replenish the stock.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_task = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please place restock orders for the following items to replenish inventory: \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"500 sheets of high-quality recycled colored cardstock and 250 sheets of A4 size printer paper. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"This is to fulfill a customer order with an urgent delivery date coming soon.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_items = {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"restock_items\": [</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        {\"description\": \"high-quality recycled colored cardstock\", \"quantity\": 500, \"unit\": \"sheets\"},</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        {\"description\": \"A4 size printer paper\", \"quantity\": 250, \"unit\": \"sheets\"}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    ],</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"priority\": \"high\",</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"requested_by\": \"customer order urgent restock\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_response = inventory_agent(task=restock_task, additional_args=restock_items)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(restock_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
