       "  <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2; text-decoration-color: #f8f8f2; background-color: #272822\">    </span><span style=\"color: #e6db74; text-decoration-color: #e6db74; background-color: #272822\">\"The requested paper supplies (glossy A4 paper sheets, matte A3 paper sheets, poster boards 24x36, and </span><span style=\"background-color: #272822\">    </span>  \n",
       "  <span style=\"color: #e6db74; text-decoration-color: #e6db74; background-color: #272822\">heavyweight cardstock sheets) are not in the inventory catalog, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #272822\">                                              </span>  \n",
       "  <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2; text-decoration-color: #f8f8f2; background-color: #272822\">    </span><span style=\"color: #e6db74; text-decoration-color: #e6db74; background-color: #272822\">\"and attempts to restock or order them have failed. The inventory system requires these items to be added </span><span style=\"background-color: #272822\"> </span>  \n",
