       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"The restock orders have been successfully placed using the closest general product categories available. \" </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"You can expect delivery ahead of the April 10, 2025 deadline as follows: 200 units of A4 paper, 100 units of </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Glossy paper, \" </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"and 50 units of Kraft paper as a substitute for recycled kraft paper envelopes. \" </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"For future orders, please use 'A4 paper' for white printer paper, 'Glossy paper' for A3 glossy paper, and </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">either source or create a new entry for recycled kraft paper envelopes or use 'Kraft paper' as a placeholder. \" </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"This approach ensures timely restocking and availability.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
