       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_check_request = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please check stock availability for the following items:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 10,000 sheets of A4 white paper\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 5,000 sheets of A3 colored paper in assorted colors\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 500 reams of cardboard for signage\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Provide current stock levels, and if any item is below requested quantity, indicate the deficit.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">             </span>\n",
