      "text/html": [
       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The inventory reveals that cardstock and colored paper are recognized categories but are currently out of </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">stock and flagged for restocking. Standard printing paper is not listed under that name, so we need to identify its</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">correct product name or alternate. I will ask the inventory agent to provide alternative names or categories </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">related to printing paper or general paper supplies so we can identify the correct product for placing the order. </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Then I will place restocking orders for cardstock and colored paper with the requested quantities.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">alternative_names_task = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please provide any alternative product names or categories in the inventory catalog that \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"might correspond to 'standard printing paper' or general printing paper supplies. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"We need these to correctly identify the item, as 'printing paper' is not listed. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Also confirm the catalog identifiers for cardstock and colored paper for placing restock orders.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">             </span>\n",
