       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restocking. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Posters and tickets are also not catalog items and must be sourced externally. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"It is recommended to promptly source all these items from external suppliers to ensure delivery by May 15, </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">2025, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"to meet the concert promotion and distribution schedule.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
